  "EXCLUSIVE DATING EXPERIENCE": "专属约会体验",
  "Dating Built for Real Life.": "为真实生活打造的约会。",
  "No endless swiping. No spam. Just verified singles connecting for real dates.": "无尽滑动。无垃圾信息。只有经过验证的单身人士，为真实约会而连接。",
  "For Men": "男士专区",
  "For Women": "女士专区",
  "Our Community Standards": "我们的社区规范",
  "Photo Verified:": "照片已验证：",
  "Every profile completes a live gesture selfie.": "每个资料都需要完成实时手势自拍验证。",
  "No Commercial Dating:": "禁止商业约会：",
  "Escorts, prostitution, and sugar dating are strictly prohibited.": "陪护、卖淫和糖偶关系严格禁止。",
  "High Quality:": "高品质：",
  "Profiles with low photo quality or abusive behavior are removed.": "照片质量低或有辱骂行为的资料将被移除。",
  "Frequently Asked Questions": "常见问题",
  "Common questions about using the Amara dating platform.": "关于使用 Amara 约会平台的常见问题。",
  "100% Private Profile": "100% 私密资料",
  "Send Date Invitations": "发送约会邀请",
  "Review & Acceptance": "审核与接受",
  "Connect on Telegram": "在 Telegram 上连接",
  "100% Free For Women": "女士 100% 免费",
  "Zero Spam or Creepy DMs": "零垃圾信息或骚扰私信",
  "You Are Always in Control": "你始终掌控一切",
  "Chat Directly on Telegram": "直接在 Telegram 聊天",
  "Your profile is completely hidden from the public feed. Women cannot search or see your pictures unless you choose to send them an invitation first.": "你的资料完全隐藏于公开动态。除非你选择先发送邀请，否则女性无法搜索或看到你的照片。",
  "Browse verified female profiles nearby or worldwide. Find someone you like and send a direct date invitation (membership required).": "浏览附近或全球的经过验证的女性资料。找到你喜欢的人并直接发送约会邀请（需要会员）。",
  "When the woman receives your invitation, she reviews your profile, photos, and date proposal. Only she can decide to accept or decline.": "当女性收到你的邀请时，她会查看你的资料、照片和约会提议。只有她可以决定接受或拒绝。",
  "No endless in-app small talk! Once she accepts, both of your Telegram handles are securely unlocked so you can chat and plan your date directly.": "无尽的站内闲聊！一旦她接受，你们的 Telegram 用户名将被安全解锁，方便你们聊天并直接安排约会。",
  "Amara is completely free for all female members. You will never be asked to pay for invitations, membership, or chatting.": "Amara 对所有女性会员完全免费。你永远不需要为邀请、会员或聊天付费。",
  "Say goodbye to hundreds of unwanted messages. Men cannot message you directly; they can only send a formal date invitation for you to review.": "告别数百条骚扰信息。男性无法直接给你发消息；他们只能发送正式的约会邀请供你审核。",
  "Invitations arrive in your Requests Inbox. Review their verified profile, photos, and background. You decide who you want to meet.": "邀请会出现在你的请求收件箱中。查看他们经过验证的资料、照片和背景。由你决定想见谁。",
  "When you accept an invite, your Telegram handle is shared with your match so you can chat conveniently where you already spend your time.": "当你接受邀请时，你的 Telegram 用户名会分享给你的匹配对象，让你们在平时聊天的地方方便交流。",
  "Why are men’s profiles hidden by default?": "为什么男性的资料默认隐藏？",
  "Why do matches move to Telegram?": "为什么匹配会转移到 Telegram？",
  "How does selfie verification work?": "自拍验证如何运作？",
  "What is our policy on sugar dating & escorting?": "我们对糖偶关系和陪护的政策是什么？",
  "Amara follows a private luxury model. Many successful, ambitious men value discretion. By hiding male profiles from the public feed, your identity remains private until you choose to invite someone.": "Amara 采用私密奢华模式。许多成功、有抱负的男性重视私密性。通过在公开动态中隐藏男性资料，你的身份将保持私密，直到你选择邀请某人。",
  "We believe dating should lead to real-life meetings, not endless in-app texting. Once mutual interest is confirmed, exchanging Telegram handles allows convenient, encrypted, and direct communication.": "我们认为约会应该通向现实生活中的见面，而不是无尽的站内短信。一旦确认双方有意，交换 Telegram 用户名即可实现便捷、加密的直接沟通。",
  "Every member must complete a real-time selfie verification during onboarding. This guarantees that every profile belongs to an authentic, live human and eliminates catfishing.": "每位成员在注册过程中必须完成实时自拍验证。这保证每个资料都属于真实、活着的人，杜绝照片欺诈。",
  "Amara strictly prohibits compensated dating, sugar arrangements, prostitution, or any financial exchange between members. Accounts violating these standards are banned permanently.": "Amara 严格禁止有偿约会、糖偶安排、卖淫或成员之间的任何资金往来。违反这些规范的账户将被永久封禁。",
